   "unit": 0,
   "title": "Furtive patach",
   "unlocks": [],
   "body": "A patach under a final chet or ayin is said before the letter, not after it: ruach, not rucha.\n\n{0}, {1}, {2}.\n\nThe accent mark shows the stress falls on the vowel before the furtive a.",
