   "id": "L0.9",
   "unit": 0,
   "title": "The divine name",
   "unlocks": [],
   "body": "The four letters YHWH are printed with vowels borrowed from adonay (\"my Lord\") or elohim, as a\nreminder not to pronounce the name as written.\n\nThe app shows the text exactly as printed, transliterates it YHWH, and glosses it\n\"YHWH (the LORD)\". Say it however you prefer: adonai, the LORD, or YHWH.\n\n{0}, {1}, {2}.",
