  {
   "id": "L1.4",
   "unit": 1,
   "title": "In, to, like: b-, l-, k-",
   "unlocks": [
    "M:be",
    "M:le",
    "M:ke",
    "M:ba",
    "M:la",
    "M:ka"
   ],
   "body": "Three one-letter prepositions: b- \"in, with, by\", l- \"to, for\", k- \"like, as\".\n\n{0} \"in the middle of\", {1} \"for signs\",\n{2} \"as\".\n\nWhen \"the\" follows, its h drops out and its vowel moves onto the preposition:\n{3} \"in the land\", {4} \"to the light\", {5}.",
