    "M:me"
   ],
   "body": "\"From\" stands alone as min- or attaches as mi- with the next letter doubled:\n{0} \"from under\".\n\nBefore a guttural it cannot double and becomes me-: {1} \"from above\".\n\nDoubled after mi- is the nun of min assimilating, the same way the article doubles.",
